  "Question": "Given \\(A=x^2+2x\\) and \\(B=2x^2-x+3\\), simplifying \\(2A-B\\) gives \\(ax+b\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are constants. Find the value of \\(a+b\\).",
